    <briefdescription>
<para>This class provides the core functionality of linking in LLVM. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It keeps a pointer to the merged module so far. It doesn&apos;t take ownership of the module since it is assumed that the user of this class will want to do something with it after the linking. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
